"THE FINALITY HANDLER (one of the five compile kinds lambda lacked). X becomes final at depth N is where optimistic acceptance hardens deontic into alethic, and the handler is the whole of its compile meaning: one fact, no objects. It is listed here rather than left to the hosts because a kind with no lambda handler is a kind the thin host cannot compile at all, which is the gap, not because the rule is complicated. The depth arrives already numeric: the host owns the LEXICAL half at the registered boundary -- regex capture and the int conversion -- and lambda receives typed values, which is exactly what _compile_frequency does before it hands off to system:h_frequency. Lambda has no digit-to-number primitive and does not need one for this.",

"THE SHARED-ROLE PROJECTION OF AN IF-THEN SUBSET. NORMA verbalizes SubsetConstraint with the Conditional snippet if {0} then {1}, so If A then B is the join-subset reading: A is a subset of B on the roles the two clauses SHARE BY NOUN -- the antecedent introduces the entities (some Message, some Rep) and the consequent re-uses them (that Message, that Rep). This answers the two projections, the positions in the antecedent and the matching positions in the consequent, in the antecedent order. A noun projects only when it is bound EXACTLY ONCE ON EACH SIDE: bound twice, the re-use is ambiguous and there is no single position to project, so it is dropped rather than resolved arbitrarily. That is the whole subtlety, and it is why the counts are compared to one rather than membership being tested. Clause parsing and the refusals for value-restricted and compound forms stay with the host: they are the lexical half at the registered boundary.",

"THE PROJECTED-SUBSET BINDING (the last compile kind outside lambda). system:subset_proj already answers WHICH roles project; this is what the compile does with them: every scoped cell of the constraint is bound to constraints:scoped_subset_projected carrying the SAME operand -- the consequent fact type and the two projections. One operand shared across the cells, not one computed per cell: the projection is a property of the if-then pair, and recomputing it per cell would let two cells of one constraint disagree. This is a designation in the metamodel sense, a predicate bound to a function, which is why it belongs here rather than in whichever host happens to be assembling the constraint.",

