    S4(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S2(A("ALPHA"), A("main:rr_pair")), A("theta:zip"))),
"THE FILLERS RESTRICT BY PREFIX, and the two edges fall out of theta:zip rather than being special-cased. zip truncates to the shorter side, so <finiteness_check> against a two-column row compares role 1 and ignores role 2 -- a restriction on the roles you supplied. An EMPTY filler zips to nothing and fp:and_all of nothing is T, so a bare GET matches every row. That is Codd-s theta-restriction with the identity restriction as its zero case, and it needed no branch to say so.",
